## The five layers

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
│         User Experience             │
├─────────────────────────────────────┤
│  HTML (structure) │ CSS (style)      │
├─────────────────────────────────────┤
│      JavaScript / ECMAScript        │
├─────────────────────────────────────┤
│         Web APIs (browser)          │
│  Canvas │ WebGL │ Workers │ WS       │
│  Storage│ Geo   │ History │ File     │
├─────────────────────────────────────┤
│     Network (HTTP/2, HTTP/3)        │
└─────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## HTML5 element groups

- **Semantic structure**: `<header>`, `<main>`, `<article>`, `<section>`, `<nav>`, `<aside>`, `<footer>`
- **Text-level**: `<mark>`, `<time>`, `<abbr>`, `<code>`, `<kbd>`, `<var>`, `<small>`, `<wbr>`
- **Embedded content**: `<video>`, `<audio>`, `<canvas>`, `<picture>`, `<source>`, `<track>`, `<svg>`
- **Forms**: `<input type=email/date/range/…>`, `<datalist>`, `<output>`, `<progress>`, `<meter>`, `<fieldset>`
- **Interactive**: `<details>`, `<summary>`, `<dialog>`
- **Scripting**: `<template>`, `<slot>` (Web Components)

